For Africans, this could be a perfect storm - 

▶️ High levels of #HIV (which increase risk of TB & #LongCOVID);
▶️ High levels of #LongCOVID (often mistaken for TB);
▶️ High levels of TB (>33% of TB deaths occur in Africa);
▶️ With most international aid to manage those diseases, cut ( #USAID).

